# The devcontainer Dockerfile (.devcontainer/Dockerfile) does not COPY or
# ADD anything from the project root. devcontainer.json sets the build
# context to ".." (project root) so the context would otherwise include
# multi-GB directories (target/, .claude/worktrees/, test parquet data),
# which Podman streams into /var/tmp on the VM and runs out of space.
#
# Excluding everything keeps the build context essentially empty, which is
# correct given the Dockerfile's actual needs. If you ever add a COPY or
# ADD to the Dockerfile, whitelist the specific path here with `!path`.

*
